<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="BP12_ManageBoardColumns" targetNamespace="http://bpmn.io/schema/bpmn">
  <bpmn:collaboration id="Collaboration_BP12_ManageBoardColumns">
    <bpmn:participant id="Participant_User" name="User" processRef="Process_User" />
    <bpmn:participant id="Participant_Bearing" name="Bearing" processRef="Process_Bearing" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_1" name="BP12.02 · Edit a column" sourceRef="T_5" targetRef="editIn" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_2" name="BP12.04 · Reorder columns" sourceRef="T_7" targetRef="reorderIn" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_3" name="BP12.05 · Change a column's role" sourceRef="T_9" targetRef="roleIn" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_4" name="BP12.10 · Set the activity Done" sourceRef="T_12" targetRef="activityIn" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_5" name="BP12.06 · Archive a column's tasks" sourceRef="T_16" targetRef="archiveIn" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_6" name="BP12.07 · See what deleting a column takes" sourceRef="T_18" targetRef="impactIn" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_7" name="BP12.08 · Delete a column" sourceRef="T_21" targetRef="deleteIn" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_8" name="The editing outcome" sourceRef="BP12.02_RenameColumn" targetRef="recorded" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_9" name="The ordering outcome" sourceRef="BP12.04_ReorderColumns" targetRef="reordered" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_10" name="The role-change outcome" sourceRef="BP12.05_ChangeColumnRole" targetRef="roleSet" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_11" name="The state-change outcome" sourceRef="BP12.10_SetTheActivityDone" targetRef="activitySet" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_12" name="The archiving outcome" sourceRef="BP12.06_ArchiveColumnTasks" targetRef="archived" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_13" name="What the deletion will take" sourceRef="BP12.07_ReadTheColumnDeletionImpact" targetRef="impact" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_14" name="The deletion outcome" sourceRef="BP12.08_DeleteColumn" targetRef="deleted" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_X1"><bpmn:text>Reaches every board the template governs (BR-108), which is why more than one activity can be left with nothing open.</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Association_X1" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="roleSet" targetRef="TextAnnotation_X1" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_X2"><bpmn:text>This is the archiving act that takes a whole column's worth at once, on the board in front of the user. The column itself stays.</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Association_X2" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="archived" targetRef="TextAnnotation_X2" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_X3"><bpmn:text>A name is the user's word for the lane; renaming never changes what an existing lane means. Where a new lane lands in the order is the ordering's business (BP12.04).</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Association_X3" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="recorded" targetRef="TextAnnotation_X3" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_X4"><bpmn:text>Answered activity by activity where the change completed several boards. A board the change completed has nothing open on it, so there is nothing to disclose and nothing to answer with the closing; declining leaves the activity InProgress, to be closed by hand on the Course page.</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Association_X4" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="activitySet" targetRef="TextAnnotation_X4" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_X5"><bpmn:text>Within BR-59 and BR-60's limits the consequences are the user's. No history is rewritten: what any span recorded as completed stands (BR-124).</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Association_X5" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="BP12.05_ChangeColumnRole" targetRef="TextAnnotation_X5" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_X6"><bpmn:text>Archiving is a conscious gesture here as everywhere: no task archives itself. This act reaches the one board the user is on, unlike a change to the template itself.</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Association_X6" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="BP12.06_ArchiveColumnTasks" targetRef="TextAnnotation_X6" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_X7"><bpmn:text>A task cannot be left without a column, so the cascade is approve-or-abandon and detaching is not offered. Deleting a lane deletes it on every board the template governs, so the disclosure counts all of them. A column empty everywhere has nothing to disclose and deletes cleanly.</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Association_X7" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="BP12.07_ReadTheColumnDeletionImpact" targetRef="TextAnnotation_X7" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_X8"><bpmn:text>A name is not a role (BR-58), so nothing here can touch the one Backlog or the last Done (BR-59). InProgress is the role most added lanes carry (`arch section 10`); saying a new lane means something else is the role act's own business. A new lane appears on every board the template governs (BR-108), and the check-out and the advisor read a lane's role, never its name.</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Association_X8" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="BP12.02_RenameColumn" targetRef="TextAnnotation_X8" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_X9"><bpmn:text>The Course page owns an activity's state (BP18); this is the completion offer answered from the column settings, as the board answers its own (BP11). A Done activity can be reopened there.</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Association_X9" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="BP12.10_SetTheActivityDone" targetRef="TextAnnotation_X9" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_X10"><bpmn:text>The Backlog column and the last Done column are refused with their reason, for the same reason their roles cannot change.</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Association_X10" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="BP12.08_DeleteColumn" targetRef="TextAnnotation_X10" />
  </bpmn:collaboration>
  <bpmn:process id="Process_User" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:startEvent id="Start_1" name="The lanes no longer fit the work">
      <bpmn:outgoing>SF_Start_1_T_2</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:task id="T_2" name="Work a column">
      <bpmn:incoming>SF_Start_1_T_2</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>SF_T_2_Gw_3</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Gw_3" name="What needs doing?">
      <bpmn:incoming>SF_T_2_Gw_3</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>SF_Gw_3_T_4</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>SF_Gw_3_T_7</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>SF_Gw_3_T_9</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>SF_Gw_3_T_16</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>SF_Gw_3_T_18</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:task id="T_4" name="Name the column">
      <bpmn:incoming>SF_Gw_3_T_4</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>SF_T_4_T_5</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="T_5" name="Submit the column">
      <bpmn:incoming>SF_T_4_T_5</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>SF_T_5_recorded</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:intermediateCatchEvent id="recorded" name="The editing outcome">
      <bpmn:incoming>SF_T_5_recorded</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>SF_recorded_End_6</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:messageEventDefinition id="MED_recorded" />
    </bpmn:intermediateCatchEvent>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_6" name="Column recorded">
      <bpmn:incoming>SF_recorded_End_6</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:task id="T_7" name="Order a column">
      <bpmn:incoming>SF_Gw_3_T_7</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>SF_T_7_reordered</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:intermediateCatchEvent id="reordered" name="The ordering outcome">
      <bpmn:incoming>SF_T_7_reordered</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>SF_reordered_End_8</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:messageEventDefinition id="MED_reordered" />
    </bpmn:intermediateCatchEvent>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_8" name="Columns ordered">
      <bpmn:incoming>SF_reordered_End_8</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:task id="T_9" name="Set the column's role">
      <bpmn:incoming>SF_Gw_3_T_9</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>SF_T_9_roleSet</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:intermediateCatchEvent id="roleSet" name="The role-change outcome">
      <bpmn:incoming>SF_T_9_roleSet</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>SF_roleSet_Gw_10</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:messageEventDefinition id="MED_roleSet" />
    </bpmn:intermediateCatchEvent>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Gw_10" name="Did the change leave an activity with no card still open?">
      <bpmn:incoming>SF_roleSet_Gw_10</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>SF_Gw_10_Gw_11</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>SF_Gw_10_End_15</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Gw_11" name="Mark the activity Done?">
      <bpmn:incoming>SF_Gw_10_Gw_11</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>SF_Gw_11_T_12</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>SF_Gw_11_End_14</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:task id="T_12" name="Mark the activity Done">
      <bpmn:multiInstanceLoopCharacteristics isSequential="true" />
      <bpmn:incoming>SF_Gw_11_T_12</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>SF_T_12_activitySet</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:intermediateCatchEvent id="activitySet" name="The state-change outcome">
      <bpmn:incoming>SF_T_12_activitySet</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>SF_activitySet_End_13</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:messageEventDefinition id="MED_activitySet" />
    </bpmn:intermediateCatchEvent>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_13" name="Activities closed">
      <bpmn:incoming>SF_activitySet_End_13</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_14" name="Activity left in progress">
      <bpmn:incoming>SF_Gw_11_End_14</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_15" name="Column role set">
      <bpmn:incoming>SF_Gw_10_End_15</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:task id="T_16" name="Archive everything in the column on this board">
      <bpmn:incoming>SF_Gw_3_T_16</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>SF_T_16_archived</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:intermediateCatchEvent id="archived" name="The archiving outcome">
      <bpmn:incoming>SF_T_16_archived</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>SF_archived_End_17</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:messageEventDefinition id="MED_archived" />
    </bpmn:intermediateCatchEvent>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_17" name="Lane cleared">
      <bpmn:incoming>SF_archived_End_17</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:task id="T_18" name="Delete a column">
      <bpmn:incoming>SF_Gw_3_T_18</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>SF_T_18_impact</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:intermediateCatchEvent id="impact" name="What the deletion will take">
      <bpmn:incoming>SF_T_18_impact</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>SF_impact_Gw_19</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:messageEventDefinition id="MED_impact" />
    </bpmn:intermediateCatchEvent>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Gw_19" name="Approve what the deletion takes?">
      <bpmn:incoming>SF_impact_Gw_19</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>SF_Gw_19_T_20</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>SF_Gw_19_End_22</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:task id="T_20" name="Select a valid cascading option">
      <bpmn:incoming>SF_Gw_19_T_20</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>SF_T_20_T_21</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="T_21" name="Confirm the deletion">
      <bpmn:incoming>SF_T_20_T_21</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>SF_T_21_deleted</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:intermediateCatchEvent id="deleted" name="The deletion outcome">
      <bpmn:incoming>SF_T_21_deleted</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>SF_deleted_End_23</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:messageEventDefinition id="MED_deleted" />
    </bpmn:intermediateCatchEvent>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_22" name="Deletion abandoned">
      <bpmn:incoming>SF_Gw_19_End_22</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_23" name="Column deleted">
      <bpmn:incoming>SF_deleted_End_23</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_Start_1_T_2" sourceRef="Start_1" targetRef="T_2" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_T_2_Gw_3" sourceRef="T_2" targetRef="Gw_3" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_T_4_T_5" sourceRef="T_4" targetRef="T_5" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_T_5_recorded" sourceRef="T_5" targetRef="recorded" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_recorded_End_6" sourceRef="recorded" targetRef="End_6" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_Gw_3_T_4" name="add a lane, or rename one" sourceRef="Gw_3" targetRef="T_4" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_T_7_reordered" sourceRef="T_7" targetRef="reordered" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_reordered_End_8" sourceRef="reordered" targetRef="End_8" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_Gw_3_T_7" name="reorder them" sourceRef="Gw_3" targetRef="T_7" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_T_9_roleSet" sourceRef="T_9" targetRef="roleSet" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_roleSet_Gw_10" sourceRef="roleSet" targetRef="Gw_10" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_T_12_activitySet" sourceRef="T_12" targetRef="activitySet" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_activitySet_End_13" sourceRef="activitySet" targetRef="End_13" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_Gw_11_T_12" name="yes" sourceRef="Gw_11" targetRef="T_12" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_Gw_11_End_14" name="no" sourceRef="Gw_11" targetRef="End_14" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_Gw_10_Gw_11" name="yes" sourceRef="Gw_10" targetRef="Gw_11" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_Gw_10_End_15" name="no" sourceRef="Gw_10" targetRef="End_15" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_Gw_3_T_9" name="change what a lane means" sourceRef="Gw_3" targetRef="T_9" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_T_16_archived" sourceRef="T_16" targetRef="archived" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_archived_End_17" sourceRef="archived" targetRef="End_17" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_Gw_3_T_16" name="clear out a lane" sourceRef="Gw_3" targetRef="T_16" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_T_18_impact" sourceRef="T_18" targetRef="impact" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_impact_Gw_19" sourceRef="impact" targetRef="Gw_19" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_T_20_T_21" sourceRef="T_20" targetRef="T_21" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_T_21_deleted" sourceRef="T_21" targetRef="deleted" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_Gw_19_T_20" name="approve" sourceRef="Gw_19" targetRef="T_20" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_Gw_19_End_22" name="reject" sourceRef="Gw_19" targetRef="End_22" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_deleted_End_23" sourceRef="deleted" targetRef="End_23" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_Gw_3_T_18" name="remove a lane" sourceRef="Gw_3" targetRef="T_18" />
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmn:process id="Process_Bearing" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:startEvent id="editIn" name="Column submitted">
      <bpmn:outgoing>SF_editIn_BP12.02_RenameColumn</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:messageEventDefinition id="MED_editIn" />
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:subProcess id="BP12.02_RenameColumn" name="Edit a column">
      <bpmn:incoming>SF_editIn_BP12.02_RenameColumn</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>SF_BP12.02_RenameColumn_End_26</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="BP12.02_RenameColumn_s" name="Start">
        <bpmn:outgoing>SF_BP12.02_RenameColumn_s_T_24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:task id="T_24" name="Store the edit, and set a new lane to InProgress">
        <bpmn:incoming>SF_BP12.02_RenameColumn_s_T_24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>SF_T_24_T_25</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:task>
      <bpmn:task id="T_25" name="Report the outcome">
        <bpmn:incoming>SF_T_24_T_25</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>SF_T_25_BP12.02_RenameColumn_e</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:task>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="BP12.02_RenameColumn_e" name="fertig">
        <bpmn:incoming>SF_T_25_BP12.02_RenameColumn_e</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_T_24_T_25" sourceRef="T_24" targetRef="T_25" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_BP12.02_RenameColumn_s_T_24" sourceRef="BP12.02_RenameColumn_s" targetRef="T_24" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_T_25_BP12.02_RenameColumn_e" sourceRef="T_25" targetRef="BP12.02_RenameColumn_e" />
    </bpmn:subProcess>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_26" name="Column answered">
      <bpmn:incoming>SF_BP12.02_RenameColumn_End_26</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="reorderIn" name="Column reordering requested">
      <bpmn:outgoing>SF_reorderIn_BP12.04_ReorderColumns</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:messageEventDefinition id="MED_reorderIn" />
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:subProcess id="BP12.04_ReorderColumns" name="Reorder columns">
      <bpmn:incoming>SF_reorderIn_BP12.04_ReorderColumns</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>SF_BP12.04_ReorderColumns_End_29</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="BP12.04_ReorderColumns_s" name="Start">
        <bpmn:outgoing>SF_BP12.04_ReorderColumns_s_T_27</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:task id="T_27" name="Apply the new order">
        <bpmn:incoming>SF_BP12.04_ReorderColumns_s_T_27</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>SF_T_27_T_28</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:task>
      <bpmn:task id="T_28" name="Report the outcome">
        <bpmn:incoming>SF_T_27_T_28</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>SF_T_28_BP12.04_ReorderColumns_e</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:task>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="BP12.04_ReorderColumns_e" name="fertig">
        <bpmn:incoming>SF_T_28_BP12.04_ReorderColumns_e</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_T_27_T_28" sourceRef="T_27" targetRef="T_28" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_BP12.04_ReorderColumns_s_T_27" sourceRef="BP12.04_ReorderColumns_s" targetRef="T_27" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_T_28_BP12.04_ReorderColumns_e" sourceRef="T_28" targetRef="BP12.04_ReorderColumns_e" />
    </bpmn:subProcess>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_29" name="Column reordering answered">
      <bpmn:incoming>SF_BP12.04_ReorderColumns_End_29</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="roleIn" name="Role submitted">
      <bpmn:outgoing>SF_roleIn_BP12.05_ChangeColumnRole</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:messageEventDefinition id="MED_roleIn" />
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:subProcess id="BP12.05_ChangeColumnRole" name="Change a column's role">
      <bpmn:incoming>SF_roleIn_BP12.05_ChangeColumnRole</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>SF_BP12.05_ChangeColumnRole_End_35</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="BP12.05_ChangeColumnRole_s" name="Start">
        <bpmn:outgoing>SF_BP12.05_ChangeColumnRole_s_Gw_30</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Gw_30" name="May this column take the role the request names?">
        <bpmn:incoming>SF_BP12.05_ChangeColumnRole_s_Gw_30</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>SF_Gw_30_T_31</bpmn:outgoing>
        <bpmn:outgoing>SF_Gw_30_T_33</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
      <bpmn:task id="T_31" name="Record the column's new role">
        <bpmn:incoming>SF_Gw_30_T_31</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>SF_T_31_T_32</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:task>
      <bpmn:task id="T_32" name="Set every card in that lane to the state the new role gives it">
        <bpmn:incoming>SF_T_31_T_32</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>SF_T_32_T_34</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:task>
      <bpmn:task id="T_33" name="Refuse the change and say why">
